   - Opens source `O_RDONLY`, opens dst `O_WRONLY|O_TRUNC` (existing) or `O_WRONLY|O_CREAT|O_TRUNC` with source mode (new — kernel applies umask)
   - Copies in 64 KiB chunks using `_write_all`
