   - After `--`, all args are literal operands
   - Requires ≥ 2 operands (else stderr + exit 1)
   - If > 2 operands: last must be an existing directory (else stderr + exit 1); each source's destination is `dest_dir/basename(source)`
   - If exactly 2 operands: if the second is an existing directory, effective dest is `dest/basename(source)`; otherwise use it directly
